+    """Build a one-condition rejection proof for an early static refusal.
+
+    Native executors use this to keep the alias decision observable (a status,
+    a failed condition and a readable reason) when their static prefix already
+    refuses a view and a full geometry/liveness fact set would be misleading.
+    """
